{
    "background_story": "Shorty was a lovable, laid-back inhabitant of the mystical realm of Aethoria. He was a Lwei, a small, mischievous creature known for their playful nature and love of pranks. Shorty lived in the heart of the Whispering Woods, where he spent his days exploring the ancient forests and playing tricks on his fellow Lwei. Despite his small stature, Shorty had a big heart and was always willing to lend a helping hand (or wing) to those in need. His signature prank, the 'Lwei Leaf Swap,' became legendary among the forest dwellers, and his infectious laughter could be heard echoing through the trees. Shorty's carefree spirit and loyal friendships made him a beloved fixture in the Aethorian community.",
